====Pronunciation notes====
* Some US dialects glottalize the final {{IPAchar|/t/}} in ''[[can't]]'' ({{IPAchar|[kæn(ʔ)]}}), so in order to differentiate ''can't'' from ''can'', they pronounce ''can'' as {{IPAchar|/kɛn/}} even when stressed.

